SUMMARY:SUMMER LEGAL Psychedelic CANNABIS Sound Healing Circle
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\n***Summer Legal Cannabis Ceremony/circl
 e on Saturday August 29*💚 Sign up right here!** [Star Sounds](https://w
 ww.starsounds.love/event-details/summer-legal-psychedelic-cannabis-sound-h
 ealing-circle) **🙏✨😀**\n**PLEASE READ TO THE END for info on what 
 you need to bring for yourself and other important information.💖 This e
 vent also has a limited amount of spaces\, so if you are interested\, plea
 se sign up early.**\nJoin us for a LEGAL psychedelic experience featuring 
 Cannabis THCa flower containing <0.3% of Delta 9 THC from local legal cann
 abis dispensaries. Legal THCa hemp flower\nwill be provided to maintain co
 nsistency and ensure everyone has access to the same quality medicine!\n**
 We ask that you bring healthy snacks to share\, eye shades\, journal/pen a
 nd smoking pipe/vaporizer or other device and a [lighter...and](http://lig
 hter...and) don't forget to bring WATER for yourself!** PLEASE ALSO BRING 
 A PAD TO LAY ON\, BLANKET AND PILLOW. **This will make your experience muc
 h more enjoyable having the proper comfort.**\nThis work helps us release 
 all the heavy energy that many of us may be carrying these days. It is als
 o very helpful for ptsd\, depression\, anxiety that many are also experien
 cing. It can help with regulating and slowing down the nervous system. Eve
 rything we need right now.\nOur guide\, Dave\, has studied with [The Cente
 r for Medicinal Mindfulness](https://medicinalmindfulness.org/) in Boulder
 \, CO to facilitate one-on-one and group psychedelic cannabis ceremonies. 
 Dave's approach is from an embodied\, mindfulness perspective. He will ask
  us to set an intention\, invite us to imbibe in the medicine\, guide us i
 n a body scan meditation\, and lead us through some light breathwork for t
 hose who want to go deeper. Dave is also a certified clinical herbalist\, 
 Energy Worker\, and Earth based healing Practitioner.\n[David Heis](https:
 //www.star-sounds.com/)s will alchemize the healing sound vibrations. Dave
  works with sound by blending the vibrations of unique instruments includi
 ng multiple gongs\, crystal singing bowls\, and other abstract sounding pi
 eces. He has been working with sound since 2012.\nA sober sitter will be p
 resent\, should you need any assistance.\nWe will meet at 4pm at The Well\
 , for everyone to introduce themselves\, discuss protocol and state their 
 intentions. We will go over any last minute details and have time for ever
 yone to settle in before we begin the experience at 5ish pm. The experienc
 e will last approximately 2 hours. Afterwards we will gather for some heal
 thy "munchies" and a group integration circle to allow plenty of time for 
 everyone to reground. We will close the circle by 10-10:30 pm.\n🌿🌿
 🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿
 🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿\n**Reminder! We ask that you bring healthy snacks
  to share\, eye shades\, journal/pen and smoking pipe/vaporizer or other d
 evice and a [lighter...and](http://lighter...and) don't forget to bring WA
 TER for yourself!** PLEASE ALSO BRING A PAD TO LAY ON\, BLANKET AND PILLOW
 . **This will make your experience much more enjoyable having the proper c
 omfort.**\n🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿
 🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿🌿\nThis is very important!\nIf 
 anyone is on any psychiatric medication\, is currently going through a big
  healing or uncomfortable process or if you have a substantial background 
 of trauma/mental instability let us know to see if you are in a safe place
  to be doing this work right now. This work is not appropriate for people 
 with heart conditions\, schizophrenia\, psychosis\, bipolar or any other s
 erious mental health conditions. Also\, it is over 21 only. Thank you\, th
 is is very important!\n**Please register here:** [Star Sounds](https://www
 .starsounds.love/event-details/summer-legal-psychedelic-cannabis-sound-hea
 ling-circle) **and don't forget to bring anything to make yourself comfort
 able..... plus the other items needed!**\nThe cost is $50-$150. When decid
 ing what to pay\, please pay what you can truly afford. This event is 6 ho
 urs and includes the medicine\, guidance and preparation time\, so bear th
 at in mind. Thank you.\nYou can pay at Vemno@Starsounds\nTo reserve your s
 pace at this event\, click on "RSVP".\nFrom previous Cannabis Circle event
 s:\n"Admittedly\, I was a bit apprehensive if this was going to be a psych
 edelic experience\; but this has totally changed my view. Prior to this ev
 ent\, my relationship with cannabis was recreational\, like most. But the 
 set\, setting and ceremony for this circle created a VERY incredible exper
 ience. If you are looking to have a new relationship with this medicine\, 
 and a very different experience\, this circle is for you." - Brian\n"*I re
 ally enjoyed the Conscious Cannabis Event. The guidance of the facilitator
 s and the sound journey was quite powerful.*\n*I valued the space that was
  created for the event with some light ceremonial aspects which helped foc
 us the intention for the experience.*\n*Having only worked with cannabis r
 ecreationally years ago\, I was surprised by how powerful of an experience
  I had and it opened my eyes and heart to a new and more conscious way for
  me to work with this medicine in the future.*\n*I would highly recommend 
 this experience for someone looking to dive deeper into themselves with a 
 safe and intentional space to do so."*\n\\- Ian\n😀🙏✨\n\nRegister h
 ere: [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.love/event-details/summer-legal-
 psychedelic-cannabis-sound-healing-circle)\nThank you!\n\\- Lawrence\\\, D
 ave\\\, and David\nVery Important Disclaimer: We do not encourage or condo
 ne any illegal activities\, the purchase\, sale\, transfer\, or use of any
  illegal substances\, or partaking in any unlawful activities related to i
 llegal substances. **DO NOT BRING ANY *ILLEGAL* SUBSTANCES TO THE MEETING 
 and DON'T BE UNDER THE EFFECTS OF ANY *ILLEGAL* SUBSTANCE DURING THE MEETI
 NG.** Thank you! Love Yourself by showing up and sharing in ComeUnity! 
